  "title": "Backpacked: World of Color",
  "description": "Add-on for Backpacked! Adds 16 dye variants to the Standard Backpack!",
  "body": "# Backpacked: World of Color\n*   An add-on for [Backpacked](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked) by MrCrayfish\n*   Adds all 16 dyed color variants to the Standard Backpack\n*   Craft a backpack using the dye of your choice to obtain the corresponding color\n*   For <= v2.0.0, all color variants are unlocked by default, no progression required\n\n## Known Issues\n*   **<= v2.0.0**\n    *   Mouse wheel scrolling does not function inside the backpack GUI\n    *   **Workaround:** Use the scrollbar on the side of the GUI to navigate backpack slots\n\n##    \n\n[![CurseForge](https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=26292F&color=F16436)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-world-of-color/files/all)\n[![Modrinth](https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=26292F&color=1AD166)](https://modrinth.com/mod/backpacked-world-of-color)\n[![Discord](https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Server-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&labelColor=26292F&color=5865f2)](https://discord.gg/Uttj34u4PJ)",
